  "bodyHash": "fc37c6db28df8200",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163560406-b4178f87-01ab-42c9-acc0-c10c82e295cc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>地牢與其他結構現在會生成首領，包含超過 29 種原版生物的首領變體</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>這些首領擁有自訂技能、數值、掉落物與行為/AI，因此每個都是不同的挑戰。<br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cupboard\" rel=\"nofollow\">新版本需要安裝 <strong>Cuboard</strong> 作為相依模組</a><br><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162617552-80038ed3-026b-42e1-8133-c00f6f9ad45e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有首領皆透過資料包建立，預設情況下本模組已內建 29 個首領。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">它們完全可自訂，您也可以輕鬆自行新增首領。您可以將幾乎任何實體（包括其他模組的實體）製作成首領。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://gist.github.com/someaddons/aa5986b9495863c3b55947a07e243395\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊此處查看完整的首領建立指南：&nbsp;https://gist.github.com/someaddons/aa5986b9495863c3b55947a07e243395</a></span></p>\n<p><br>測試首領的指令：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>/brutalbosses spawnboss all&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;生成所有首領<br>/brutalbosses spawnboss random&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;生成隨機首領<br>/brutalbosses spawnboss &lt;filename&gt;&nbsp; &nbsp;生成特定首領</p>\n</div>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163059508-bfcdb9fc-5f49-4204-afff-d9ae9460beda.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組與任何會新增可戰利箱子/容器的結構相容，因為首領會在這些箱子旁生成。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用原版戰利品表的結構天生相容，其他結構可透過資料包明確新增支援。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">預設已包含以下結構模組的相容性：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Awesome Dungeon<br>Awesome Dungeon Edition Ocean</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Awesome Dungeon Nether<br>Awesome Dungeon End</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Bygone Nether<br>Dungeon Crawl<br>Dungeons Enhanced<br>Dungeons Plus<br>End Remastered<br>Goblins &amp; Dungeons<br>Illagers+<br>Infernal Expansion</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>It Takes a Pillage<br>Mo' Structures</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Phillips Ruins<br>Stoneholm: Underground Villages<br>The Graveyard</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>The Lost Castle</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br>Towns and Towers<br>Towers of the Wild: Reloaded<br>Towers of the Wild: Additions<br>Valhelsia Structures<br>When Dungeons Arise</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>William Wyther's Structures<br>YUNG's Better Dungeons<br>YUNG's Better Strongholds</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;遺漏了某個模組？您可以輕鬆透過資料包新增支援，請參考首領建立指南中的生成章節：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://gist.github.com/someaddons/aa5986b9495863c3b55947a07e243395\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://gist.github.com/someaddons/aa5986b9495863c3b55947a07e243395</a> <span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有首領列表：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/685/archmageboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/686/blazeboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/687/cavespiderboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/688/drownedboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"630\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/689/endervindicatorboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/690/evokerboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/691/evokersummoner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/692/ghastboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/693/guardianboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/694/huskboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/695/irongolemboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/696/madcowboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/697/phantomboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/698/piglinbruteboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/699/pillagerboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/700/rabbitboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/701/shulkerboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/702/skeletonshieldboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/703/snowgolemboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/704/strayboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/705/vexboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/706/vindicatorboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/707/witchboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/708/witherskeletonrangedboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/709/witherskeletonshieldboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/710/zoglinboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/711/zombieboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/712/zombietoxicboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
